; SLES53974
; Dragon Quest - The Journey of the Cursed King
; codes by bucanero, offsets from game-tools-collection save editor
;
; Checksum (u32 at 0x08) = sum of (byte % 0xFF) at 0x40, 0x80, ... 0x2E40.
; The SW/BSD codes never change those bytes, so no checksum fix is needed.
; The [python:] cheats edit checksummed bytes; the Python "Update Checksum"
; code at the end recomputes it (python/dq8.py). Apollo PS2 has no Python and
; skips all [python:] codes, so the SW/BSD codes stay valid there.

:BESLES-53974dq8_*

[INFO:Python codes need Apollo with Python support (not Apollo PS2)]

[INFO:Also select the checksum update code at the end of this list for the Python cheats]

